    "_comment": "Point-to-point commuter drive-time runs — the ONLY numeric on-air channel (surfaces as a headline only at >=5 min delay; below that it is a suppressed aside, never voiced). Each key MUST match a MarketSchedule.MarketId (matched case-insensitively). Endpoints are a STARTER SET of well-known arterials for ARN to confirm/replace per market; drive times are computed live by HERE, never stored. Unmatched markets are a safe no-op.",
